cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "sydost-tracekit: reference memory traces of virtual machines and accuracy of accumulated-deficit estimates from samples"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for recording reference memory traces of virtual machines (a
  stdlib-only guest recorder and a libvirt host collector), for estimating the
  accumulated memory deficit from samples with explicit error bounds (hold and
  linear reconstruction, refined hold bound, exact integral of the positive part),
  for choosing a sampling rate for a target error, and for tuning the monitoring
  configuration by a Pareto front.
